    title: 'IHM Alumni',
    template: 'alumniHub',
    description: 'At IHM, we\'re proud to support healthcare and social work professionals at every stage of their careers. This space is for our students and alumni, to',
    text: 'Stay Connected · Grow · Give Back Your healthcare career starts here. Your impact lasts a lifetime. At IHM, we\'re proud to support healthcare and social work professionals at every stage of their careers. This space is for our students and alumni, to celebrate achievements, share inspiring journeys, stay connected, and discover new opportunities in healthcare. Share your story Explore alumni stories Graduation Day · Melbourne Graduation Day · Class of 2026 Graduation Moments photos: Celebrate the achievements of our students and alumni through graduation moments, inspiring journeys, and career milestones that reflect the IHM experience. 0 Alumni Worldwide 0 Placement Partners 0 Countries Represented 0 Years of Excellence A truly global family Our alumni come from everywhere From Perth to the Philippines, Melbourne to Kenya — IHM graduates bring their cultures with them and carry Australian healthcare and social work expertise back to the world. 🇰🇪 Kenya 🇹🇼 Taiwan 🇫🇯 Fiji 🇬🇧 United Kingdom 🇮🇪 Ireland 🇨🇦 Canada 🇯🇵 Japan 🇮🇳 India 🇵🇭 Philippines 🇳🇵 Nepal 🇰🇷 South Korea 🇧🇹 Bhutan 🇱🇰 Sri Lanka 🇵🇰 Pakistan 🇿🇲 Zambia 🇦🇺 Australia ...and dozens more nations represented across our campuses in Melbourne, Sydney, Perth and Brisbane. Real journeys. Real impact. Alumni stories in their own words Watch IHM graduates share how their course changed their careers - from the latest Master of Nursing cohort to Bachelor of Social Work, Graduate Certificate in Advanced Nursing to NCLEX and OSCE success stories. ▶ Master of Nursing Mariah shares what completing her Master of Nursing at IHM has meant for her career and her new life in Australia. Meet Mariah - Master of Nursing graduate ▶ Master of Nursing April Rose, from the Philippines, talks about the support and hands-on learning she found throughout the Master of Nursing program. April Rose\'s student journey ▶ Master of Nursing Mikaela shares how IHM helped her make the leap from the Philippines to practising as a Registered Nurse in Australia. From the Philippines to Registered Nurse in Australia ▶ Master of Nursing Miho, from Japan, explains how IHM is helping her build her nursing career in Australia step by step. Building a nursing career in Australia ▶ GCAN Brenda balanced full-time work with AHPRA registration prep, and shares why the Graduate Certificate in Advanced Nursing was the right fit. Working full-time & prepping for AHPRA - why I chose GCAN ▶ Master of Nursing Sandhiya reflects on her student experience at IHM and the confidence her training gave her as a nurse. Sandhiya\'s IHM experience ▶ Master of Nursing Eric, one of our proud Master of Nursing graduates from Batch 2025, shares the highlights of his IHM journey. Meet Eric - Master of Nursing graduate, Batch 2025 ▶ Bachelor of Social Work Sherin shares her inspiring journey through IHM\'s Bachelor of Social Work and where it has taken her career. Sherin\'s inspiring BSW testimony More stories on IHM\'s YouTube channel → In their words What our graduates say Written testimonials from IHM\'s student testimonial pages. " What attracted me to the Master of Nursing at IHM is the great campus in Melbourne and the supportive environment and culture. The school\'s cultural gala promotes socialisation and cultural exchange among students from diverse backgrounds. Nimfa Marano Master of Nursing " Attaining nursing registration during my Master\'s was the best thing that happened to me. The program has been transformative - it empowered me to make a meaningful difference in the healthcare industry. Qhayam Mohammed Master of Nursing " The IHM teachers give me super guidance and support. They are always available to clarify my doubts and lead me to success. I am always thankful to them. Ajitha Njarackel Arjunan NCLEX-RN Preparation Graduation moments Celebrating your achievement A compact graduate spotlight built from verified videos on IHM\'s current YouTube channel. The layout stays editorial and balanced, so the ',
