    text: 'GCAN Admission Guide Everything You Need to Know to Complete Your Automated GCAN Enrolment Jump to Enroll Before You Start Welcome! This guide will walk you through the complete GCAN enrolment process. Please read through this entire page before beginning your journey to ensure a smooth experience. Step-by-Step GCAN Admission Process Follow these steps carefully to complete your GCAN enrolment. The entire process is designed to be simple and guided. Interact with the Admission Agent Start a conversation with our AI-powered Admission Agent who will answer all your questions about the IHM GCAN Course and its various specializations. Feel free to ask about course content, career opportunities, learning outcomes, and anything else you’d like to know! Complete the Application Form Once you’re ready, you’ll fill out the application form and confirm your course selection. Make sure all information is accurate! Review and Sign Your Offer Letter After your application is submitted, an official offer letter will be automatically generated with your application details. You’ll be able to review the letter, provide any additional necessary information and consent, and sign it electronically using our online signing platform. Once you’ve reviewed everything carefully, simply add your signature and submit! Make Payment and Setup Subscription You’ll be redirected to a secure payment page where you’ll pay the initial course fee. The system will automatically set up your monthly payment plans. All payments are processed securely through Stripe. Access the IHM Portal and Start Learning! Congratulations! Once your payment is confirmed, you’ll receive an email with your login credentials for the IHM Portal. Use these credentials to log in and immediately start your learning journey. Welcome to the IHM GCAN Course! What Happens After You Apply? Once you’ve completed your application, signed your offer letter, and completed payment: 1 ✍️ Offer Letter Saved Your signed offer letter is saved and stored in your account for future reference 2 💳 Automatic Payments Processed Your monthly subscription payments will be automatically processed based on your chosen payment plan 3 📧 Receive Login Credentials You’ll receive an email with your unique IHM Portal login credentials and welcome information 4 🚀 Start Your Learning Journey Log in to the portal and start exploring your course materials, specializations, and resources right away 5 🤝 Dedicated Support Available Our support team is available 24/7 to help you throughout your learning journey and beyond Helpful Tips for a Smooth Application 1 📶 Use a Reliable Internet Don’t start the application on mobile data or unstable WiFi. A stable connection is essential for a smooth experience. 2 💬 Chat with Admission Agent Ask all your questions before starting the formal application. The agent is here to clarify any doubts. 3 🎯 Be Specific with Questions Ask detailed questions about specializations and course content. The Admission Agent has comprehensive information available. 4 💰 Keep Payment Card Ready Have your payment card available when you reach the final payment step. The process is secure and quick. 5 📬 Check Email Regularly Monitor your inbox for important emails including your IHM Portal login credentials and confirmations. 6 🔐 Save Your Credentials Keep your login details safe and secure. Store them in a secure location for future access to the portal. 7 🚨 Check Spam Folder Important emails may sometimes end up in spam. Always check your spam folder for critical communications. 8 🆘 Don’t Hesitate to Ask The Admission Agent is here to help. Don’t hesitate to reach out if you’re unsure about anything during the process. Common Questions The Admission Agent is an AI-powered chatbot designed to guide you through the entire application process. It can answer questions about the GCAN course, specializations and entry requirements – all in real-time! Absolutely! The Admission Agent has detailed kn'