    path: '/regulatory-announcements/',
    title: 'Regulatory Announcements',
    template: 'policy',
    description: 'At IHM, we strive to provide transparent and up-to-date information regarding regulatory announcements that may affect our institution and the education',
    text: 'Regulatory Announcements Your first step starts right here. Dear Students, Parents, and Staff, At IHM, we strive to provide transparent and up-to-date information regarding regulatory announcements that may affect our institution and the education community as a whole. This page serves as a dedicated resource to keep you informed about any relevant regulatory updates, ensuring that you have access to accurate and timely information. In compliance with our commitment to transparency, please find below the most recent regulatory announcements affecting IHM and the broader educational landscape: Please note that these regulatory announcements are subject to change, and we encourage you to regularly visit this page for updates. We understand that staying informed is essential, and we are dedicated to promptly sharing any new developments that may arise. If you have any questions or concerns related to these regulatory announcements or any other matters, please do not hesitate to contact IHM at ihmstudentsupport@ihm.edu.au.. Our team will be happy to assist you and provide the necessary guidance. We appreciate your cooperation and understanding as we work together to ensure compliance with relevant regulations and provide the best possible educational experience for our students. Presentation on Commercial Cheating Click here to visit www.teqsa.gov.au',
