    text: "Research at IHM Overview The Institute of Health & Management (IHM) is committed to advancing impactful, ethical, and practice-informed research that addresses contemporary challenges in health, nursing, aged care, digital health, and health management. Adjunct Appointments: an honorary academic title held for up to five years, from Adjunct Lecturer to Adjunct Professor. Research Vision: to be a globally connected, practice-oriented higher education institution recognised for impactful research that improves health outcomes, workforce capability, and health systems. Our Research Team: Dr. Chandana Hewege, Dr. Abhishek Sharma, Dr. Priyanka Malaiyappan.",
