    text: 'Meet Our Support Team At the Institute of Health & Management (IHM), we are committed to providing you with comprehensive support throughout your academic journey. Our dedicated support staff is here to assist you with any queries or concerns, ensuring you have access to the resources you need to succeed. Whether you need help with counselling, academic advice, or general support, our friendly team is ready to guide you. Below, you can find the contact details for our key support staff members: Homa Freeman Registrar Location: North Melbourne Ms Avanish Kaur Student Administration Coordinator Location: SGT, Perth Ms Bharti Sharma Student Support Officer Location: Paramatta, Sydney Matthew Schweigert Student Support Officer Location: Melbourne Swathi Chandra Jithesh Student Support Officer Location: Melbourne Mehroz Minaz Chogle Campus Administration Coordinator Location: Melbourne Shruti Arora Student Support Officer, IHM Location: Melbourne Campus Managers Jimmy Jacob Campus Manager, IHM Location: Melbourne Justin Jose Campus Manager, IHM Location: Melbourne Justin Jacob Campus Manager, IHM Location: Perth Salil Mathew Campus Manager, IHM Location: Sydney Sabarish Babu Campus Manager, IHM Location: Brisbane',
